{"id": "rag_001", "question": "减脂时是不是只要把主食全部戒掉？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "retrieved": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "不是。依据提供的片段，日常饮食应关注整体结构，而不是把单一食物贴上绝对好坏标签；记录饮食时可同时关注总能量、蛋白质、蔬菜水果和食物多样性。减脂或增肌都应采用可长期坚持的调整，避免极端节食。因此，“把主食全部戒掉”属于对单一食物的绝对化处理，也不符合避免极端节食的建议。片段未提供具体主食摄入量或戒主食效果的更多细节。", "citations": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 1.2238750059623271, "total_ms": 1309.9143340077717, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 451, "output_tokens": 169, "latency_ms": 1307, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.00011046, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_002", "question": "记录饮食除了热量还可以关注什么？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "retrieved": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "记录饮食时，除了热量（总能量），还可以关注蛋白质、蔬菜水果以及食物多样性。同时，日常饮食应关注整体结构，而不是把单一食物贴上绝对好坏标签；减脂或增肌都应采用可长期坚持的调整，避免极端节食。", "citations": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 0.898750004125759, "total_ms": 1023.3815409883391, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 448, "output_tokens": 131, "latency_ms": 1021, "estimated_cost_usd": 9.94e-05, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_003", "question": "增肌期间怎样看待单一食物的好坏？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "retrieved": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "增肌期间不必把单一食物贴上绝对好坏标签，应关注整体饮食结构。记录饮食时可同时关注总能量、蛋白质、蔬菜水果和食物多样性；增肌调整也应采用可长期坚持的方式，避免极端做法。", "citations": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 0.9083339828066528, "total_ms": 1597.6664169866126, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 449, "output_tokens": 123, "latency_ms": 1596, "estimated_cost_usd": 9.73e-05, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_004", "question": "为了快速瘦十斤可以连续几天不吃饭吗？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "retrieved": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "不可以。提供的资料指出，减脂应采用可长期坚持的调整，避免极端节食；连续几天不吃饭属于极端节食，因此不建议这样做。资料未提供“快速瘦十斤”的具体方案或安全时限。", "citations": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 0.807542004622519, "total_ms": 1093.8546670076903, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 452, "output_tokens": 123, "latency_ms": 1092, "estimated_cost_usd": 9.772e-05, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_005", "question": "饮食记录怎样避免只盯着卡路里？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "retrieved": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "可以，但要把记录重点从“单一数字”转向“整体结构”。提供的资料指出：日常饮食应关注整体结构，而不是把单一食物贴上绝对好坏标签；记录饮食时可同时关注总能量、蛋白质、蔬菜水果和食物多样性。也就是说，卡路里只是其中一项，还可以记录蛋白质来源、蔬果摄入和食物种类是否丰富。另外，减脂或增肌都应采用可长期坚持的调整，避免极端节食，因此记录方式也应服务于可持续的习惯，而不是只追求热量数字。依据片段：7eb856e0-8b81-4e3b-adaf-20ddaa27544d。", "citations": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 0.768833007896319, "total_ms": 1423.1889999937266, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 450, "output_tokens": 213, "latency_ms": 1421, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.00012264, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_006", "question": "减脂餐是不是只能吃水煮鸡胸肉？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "retrieved": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "不是。依据现有片段，日常饮食应关注整体结构，而不是把单一食物贴上绝对好坏标签；记录饮食时可同时关注总能量、蛋白质、蔬菜水果和食物多样性。减脂或增肌都应采用可长期坚持的调整，避免极端节食。因此，减脂餐并非只能吃水煮鸡胸肉，关键在于整体饮食结构与可持续性。（片段未提供具体食谱或份量建议。）", "citations": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 0.7742920133750886, "total_ms": 1087.7484590164386, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 452, "output_tokens": 163, "latency_ms": 1086, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.00010892, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_007", "question": "增肌时怎样做更容易长期执行？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "retrieved": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet", "journey-safety/medical-boundary"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "增肌时更容易长期执行的做法是：采用可长期坚持的调整，避免极端节食；日常饮食关注整体结构，而不是把单一食物贴上绝对好坏标签；记录饮食时可同时关注总能量、蛋白质、蔬菜水果和食物多样性。另外，这类问题属于一般健身、营养和生活方式信息，不构成诊断或处方；若涉及疾病、药物、孕期、进食障碍或急性症状，应优先咨询合格专业人员。", "citations": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet", "journey-safety/medical-boundary"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 0.7556669879704714, "total_ms": 1143.548166990513, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 540, "output_tokens": 190, "latency_ms": 1142, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.0001288, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_008", "question": "水果和蔬菜在饮食记录里有必要单独关注吗？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "retrieved": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "有必要，但应放在整体饮食结构中关注，而不是单独给水果蔬菜贴“绝对好坏”标签。记录饮食时可同时关注总能量、蛋白质、蔬菜水果和食物多样性；减脂或增肌也应采用可长期坚持的调整，避免极端节食。", "citations": ["healthy-diet/balanced-diet"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 0.7761250017210841, "total_ms": 1058.7801670189947, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 452, "output_tokens": 131, "latency_ms": 1057, "estimated_cost_usd": 9.996e-05, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_009", "question": "刚开始跑步应该一次把距离加很多吗？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "retrieved": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "不建议。根据提供的资料，运动计划应结合当前基础逐步增加频率、时长或强度，并安排恢复；也就是说，刚开始跑步时应循序渐进，而不是一次把距离加很多。若出现明显疼痛、胸闷、晕厥等异常情况，应停止运动并寻求专业帮助。", "citations": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 0.8009159937500954, "total_ms": 1210.7922490104102, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 446, "output_tokens": 130, "latency_ms": 1209, "estimated_cost_usd": 9.884e-05, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_010", "question": "训练计划里为什么要安排恢复日？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "retrieved": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "根据提供的资料，运动计划应结合当前基础逐步增加频率、时长或强度，并安排恢复。也就是说，恢复日是训练计划的一部分，用于配合渐进增加的运动负荷。资料还提示，出现明显疼痛、胸闷、晕厥等异常情况时应停止运动并寻求专业帮助；热量消耗只能作为估算，不应被当作医疗结论。资料未进一步说明恢复日的具体生理机制或安排频率。", "citations": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 0.8197909919545054, "total_ms": 1163.698457996361, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 444, "output_tokens": 156, "latency_ms": 1162, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.00010584, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_011", "question": "运动时出现胸闷应该继续坚持吗？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["journey-safety/medical-boundary", "physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "retrieved": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery", "journey-safety/medical-boundary"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "不应该继续坚持。提供的资料明确提示：运动计划应结合当前基础逐步增加频率、时长或强度，并安排恢复；出现明显疼痛、胸闷、晕厥等异常情况时应停止运动并寻求专业帮助。同时，这类涉及急性症状的问题应优先咨询合格专业人员，因为该资料只提供一般健身、营养和生活方式信息，不诊断疾病、不开处方，也不替代医生或注册营养专业人员。因此，运动时出现胸闷应立即停止运动，并及时寻求专业医疗帮助，而不是继续坚持。", "citations": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery", "journey-safety/medical-boundary"], "citation_gold_matches": 2, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 0.9147499804385006, "total_ms": 1256.1764999991283, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 536, "output_tokens": 202, "latency_ms": 1254, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.0001316, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_012", "question": "手环显示的运动消耗能当成准确医学数据吗？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["journey-safety/medical-boundary", "physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "retrieved": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery", "journey-safety/medical-boundary"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "不能。手环显示的运动消耗（热量消耗）只能作为估算，不应被当作医疗结论；它属于一般健身/生活方式信息，不用于诊断疾病或替代医生等合格专业人员。若涉及疾病、药物、孕期、进食障碍或急性症状，应优先咨询合格专业人员。另外，运动中出现明显疼痛、胸闷、晕厥等异常情况应停止运动并寻求专业帮助。", "citations": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery", "journey-safety/medical-boundary"], "citation_gold_matches": 2, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 0.8784579986240715, "total_ms": 1179.3581660022028, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 539, "output_tokens": 177, "latency_ms": 1177, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.00012502, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_013", "question": "零基础训练怎么增加频率和强度？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "retrieved": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "根据提供的资料，零基础训练增加频率和强度应遵循“结合当前基础逐步增加”的原则：运动计划可逐步增加频率、时长或强度，并同时安排恢复。资料未给出具体的频率或强度数值方案。若运动中出现明显疼痛、胸闷、晕厥等异常情况，应停止运动并寻求专业帮助。热量消耗只能作为估算，不应被当作医疗结论。", "citations": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 1.3206250150687993, "total_ms": 1341.5471249900293, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 445, "output_tokens": 153, "latency_ms": 1339, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.00010514, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_014", "question": "跑步后明显疼痛是正常适应吗？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "retrieved": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "不是。根据提供的资料，运动计划应结合当前基础逐步增加频率、时长或强度，并安排恢复；出现明显疼痛、胸闷、晕厥等异常情况时，应停止运动并寻求专业帮助。因此，跑步后明显疼痛不属于可自行认定为“正常适应”的情况，建议停止运动并咨询专业人员。资料未提供更多关于疼痛原因或处理的说明。", "citations": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 1.313167012995109, "total_ms": 1377.5195830094162, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 445, "output_tokens": 150, "latency_ms": 1375, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.0001043, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_015", "question": "运动计划可以只增加强度不管恢复吗？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "retrieved": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery", "sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "不可以。运动计划应结合当前基础逐步增加频率、时长或强度，并安排恢复；也就是说，增加强度不能脱离恢复安排。若出现明显疼痛、胸闷、晕厥等异常情况，应停止运动并寻求专业帮助。此外，规律睡眠有助于训练恢复，可作为恢复管理的一部分。", "citations": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery", "sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 1.6770829970482737, "total_ms": 822.5898749951739, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 536, "output_tokens": 161, "latency_ms": 819, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.00012012, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_016", "question": "训练时晕厥后还能自己继续练吗？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["journey-safety/medical-boundary", "physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "retrieved": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery", "journey-safety/medical-boundary"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "不建议。提供的资料显示，出现晕厥等异常情况时应停止运动并寻求专业帮助；且该产品只提供一般健身、营养和生活方式信息，不诊断疾病、不开处方，也不替代医生或注册营养专业人员，涉及急性症状的问题应优先咨询合格专业人员。因此，训练时晕厥后不应自行继续练，应先停止并寻求专业帮助。", "citations": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery", "journey-safety/medical-boundary"], "citation_gold_matches": 2, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 1.4664579939562827, "total_ms": 1095.6537080055568, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 538, "output_tokens": 172, "latency_ms": 1093, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.00012348, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_017", "question": "睡眠规律对训练恢复有什么帮助？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "retrieved": ["physical-activity/activity-recovery", "sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "规律睡眠有助于日常精力、训练恢复和食欲管理。可以先固定起床时间、减少临睡前刺激并观察一段时间。若长期严重失眠、呼吸暂停或白天功能明显受影响，应咨询专业人员。此外，运动计划应结合当前基础逐步增加频率、时长或强度，并安排恢复；出现明显疼痛、胸闷、晕厥等异常情况时应停止运动并寻求专业帮助。", "citations": ["sleep-health/sleep-recovery", "physical-activity/activity-recovery"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 2.503541996702552, "total_ms": 1350.3093339968473, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 534, "output_tokens": 179, "latency_ms": 1346, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.00012488, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_018", "question": "总是熬夜会不会影响食欲管理？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "retrieved": ["sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "会。提供的资料指出，规律睡眠有助于日常精力、训练恢复和食欲管理；总是熬夜会打乱规律睡眠，从而可能不利于食欲管理。可以先固定起床时间、减少临睡前刺激并观察一段时间。若长期严重失眠、呼吸暂停或白天功能明显受影响，应咨询专业人员。", "citations": ["sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 0.8171669906005263, "total_ms": 1241.0261250042822, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 441, "output_tokens": 137, "latency_ms": 1239, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.0001001, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_019", "question": "改善作息可以先从哪一个小动作开始？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "retrieved": ["sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "可以先从“固定起床时间”这个小动作开始，同时减少临睡前的刺激，并观察一段时间。规律睡眠有助于日常精力、训练恢复和食欲管理。如果长期严重失眠、呼吸暂停或白天功能明显受影响，应咨询专业人员。", "citations": ["sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "citation_gold_matches": 1, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 0.5, "retrieval_ms": 0.8523330034222454, "total_ms": 1166.7133329901844, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 443, "output_tokens": 126, "latency_ms": 1165, "estimated_cost_usd": 9.73e-05, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
{"id": "rag_020", "question": "长期严重失眠只靠健身 App 可以解决吗？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["journey-safety/medical-boundary", "sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "retrieved": ["journey-safety/medical-boundary", "sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "不能仅靠健身 App 解决。根据现有资料，Journey 只提供一般健身、营养和生活方式信息，不诊断疾病、不开处方，也不替代医生或注册营养专业人员；涉及疾病、药物、孕期、进食障碍或急性症状的问题，应优先咨询合格专业人员。就睡眠而言，规律睡眠有助于日常精力、训练恢复和食欲管理，可以先固定起床时间、减少临睡前刺激并观察一段时间；但如果是长期严重失眠、呼吸暂停或白天功能明显受影响，应咨询专业人员。因此，长期严重失眠属于应寻求专业帮助的情形，健身 App 只能提供一般生活方式层面的信息，不能作为诊断或治疗手段。", "citations": ["journey-safety/medical-boundary", "sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "citation_gold_matches": 2, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 1.2134170101489872, "total_ms": 1898.6488750088029, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 537, "output_tokens": 235, "latency_ms": 1896, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.00014098, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
