{"id": "rag_022", "question": "白天功能明显受影响的失眠该怎么办？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["journey-safety/medical-boundary", "sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "retrieved": ["sleep-health/sleep-recovery", "journey-safety/medical-boundary"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "如果失眠已经导致白天功能明显受影响，提供的资料建议咨询专业人员；同时可以先从生活方式入手，例如固定起床时间、减少临睡前刺激，并观察一段时间。若属于长期严重失眠或伴有呼吸暂停，也应咨询专业人员。需要说明的是，这里只提供一般健身、营养和生活方式信息，不进行诊断或开处方，也不能替代医生或注册营养专业人员；涉及疾病、药物、孕期、进食障碍或急性症状时，应优先咨询合格专业人员。", "citations": ["sleep-health/sleep-recovery", "journey-safety/medical-boundary"], "citation_gold_matches": 2, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 0.5, "retrieval_ms": 1.1405839759390801, "total_ms": 1106.3074589765165, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 533, "output_tokens": 198, "latency_ms": 1104, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.00013006, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
