{"id": "rag_024", "question": "呼吸暂停长期存在时只调整起床时间够吗？", "should_abstain": false, "expected_document_ids": ["journey-safety/medical-boundary", "sleep-health/sleep-recovery"], "retrieved": ["sleep-health/sleep-recovery", "journey-safety/medical-boundary"], "recall": 1.0, "answer": "不够。提供的资料只说明：规律睡眠有助于日常精力、训练恢复和食欲管理，可以先固定起床时间、减少临睡前刺激并观察一段时间；但如果是长期严重失眠、呼吸暂停或白天功能明显受影响，应咨询专业人员。也就是说，呼吸暂停长期存在时，仅调整起床时间并不足以处理，应寻求专业评估。另需注意，Journey 只提供一般健身、营养和生活方式信息，不诊断疾病、不开处方，也不替代医生或注册营养专业人员。", "citations": ["sleep-health/sleep-recovery", "journey-safety/medical-boundary"], "citation_gold_matches": 2, "abstained": false, "reference_term_coverage": 1.0, "retrieval_ms": 2.9407080146484077, "total_ms": 1357.0343739993405, "invocation": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 537, "output_tokens": 202, "latency_ms": 1352, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.00013174, "fallback_used": false, "error_code": null}}
